 "remarks": "Fantastic single family rental in East Norwalk!! - Updated kitchen with stainless steel appliances! - Light & bright living room with recessed lighting - Primary bedroom offers good closet space and an amazing en suite bath with tile shower and soaker tub! - Private back yard with stone patio - 1 car garage + additional driveway parking - Walk to East Norwalk restaurants + East Norwalk Train Station! - Short drive or bike ride to the beach - Easy access to SoNo and highways! - 1 dog considered on case by case basis with $50 / month pet fee - List price is for an 18 month lease term",
